    "content": {
      "type": "policy-content",
      "settings": {
        "content": "<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 22, 2024</p>\n<p>Welcome to <strong>eJuno</strong>. Your privacy is important to us, and this Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal information. This policy applies to all visitors, customers, and users of our services through <a href=\"https://ejuno.io/\">ejuno.io</a> and related channels (collectively referred to as the \"Services\").</p>\n<p><strong>1. Overview of Our Privacy Practices</strong></p>\n<p>We collect and process personal information to provide and improve our services, fulfil legal obligations, and maintain a secure environment.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The types of personal information we collect and how we use it.</li>\n<li>How we share your data with trusted third parties.</li>\n<li>Your rights under applicable privacy laws and how to exercise them.</li>\n<li>How we protect your data and ensure its security.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you have questions, you can contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ejuno.io\">support@ejuno.io</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Information We Collect</strong></p>\n<p><strong>2.1 Information You Provide to Us Directly</strong></p>\n<p>We collect information that you provide when:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Creating an account.</li>\n<li>Placing an order.</li>\n<li>Contacting customer support.</li>\n<li>Subscribing to our newsletters or marketing communications.</li>\n<li>Participating in surveys, promotions, or reviews.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Examples of personal information we collect directly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Name, email address, phone number, billing and shipping addresses.</li>\n<li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Items purchased, payment details, and transaction history.</li>\n<li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Username, password, and preferences.</li>\n<li><strong>Feedback and Communication:</strong> Messages, reviews, and responses to surveys.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2.2 Information Automatically Collected</strong></p>\n<p>We automatically collect certain data about your interaction with our Site, such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Technical Information:</strong> Device type, operating system, browser type, IP address.</li>\n<li><strong>Usage Information:</strong> Pages viewed, time spent on the Site, and interaction data.</li>\n<li><strong>Location Data:</strong> Geolocation data based on your IP address or device settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2.3 Information from Third Parties</strong></p>\n<p>We may receive additional information from third parties, such as:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Shopify, payment processors, shipping partners, and analytics providers.</li>\n<li><strong>Social Media Platforms:</strong> Data from social media interactions, such as likes or comments.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. How We Use Your Information</strong></p>\n<p>We use your personal information for purposes, including but not limited to:</p>\n<p><strong>3.1 Providing Services and Fulfilling Orders</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Send promotional offers, newsletters, and advertisements tailored to your preferences.</li>\n<li>Analyse your activity to improve the user experience.</li>\n<li>Customise your interaction with our Services based on your browsing or purchasing behaviour.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3.3 Security and Fraud Prevention</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Detect and prevent fraudulent transactions, account misuse, or other malicious activities.</li>\n<li>Protect our users and systems from unauthorised access or threats.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3.4 Legal Compliance and Obligations</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Comply with legal obligations, regulatory requirements, and the enforcement of our Terms of Service.</li>\n<li>Respond to lawful requests, such as subpoenas or legal investigations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. Sharing Your Information</strong></p>\n<p>We share your information only when necessary and with trusted entities, such as:</p>\n<p><strong>4.1 Service Providers</strong></p>\n<p>We share data with third parties that help us operate the Services, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Payment processors (e.g., Stripe, PayPal).</li>\n<li>Shipping and logistics providers (e.g., DHL, FedEx).</li>\n<li>IT and cloud storage providers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4.2 Marketing and Analytics Partners</strong></p>\n<p>We may collaborate with marketing firms or analytics providers to improve our offerings. These entities are contractually bound to protect your data and use it only for specified purposes.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</strong></p>\n<p>We use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Enhance functionality (e.g., remembering preferences).</li>\n<li>Conduct analytics to understand user behaviour.</li>\n<li>Deliver personalised advertisements.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings. However, doing so may affect your experience with certain features of the Services.</p>\n<p><strong>6. Data Retention</strong></p>\n<p>We retain your personal information as long as necessary to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provide the Services.</li>\n<li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>\n<li>Resolve disputes.</li>\n<li>Enforce our agreements.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Data that is no longer required will be securely deleted or anonymised.</p>\n<p><strong>7. Your Rights</strong></p>\n<p>Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding your personal data, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of your personal data.</li>\n<li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>\n<li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request the deletion of your personal data, subject to certain exceptions.</li>\n<li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Obtain your data in a structured format.</li>\n<li><strong>Restriction:</strong> Limit how we use your data.</li>\n<li><strong>Objection:</strong> Opt out of certain uses of your data, including marketing.</li>\n<li><strong>Withdraw Consent:</strong> Revoke consent for specific data processing activities.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ejuno.io\">support@ejuno.io</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>8. International Data Transfers</strong></p>\n<p>Your information may be processed in countries with privacy laws different from those in your jurisdiction. For transfers outside the EEA, we use Standard Contractual Clauses or other recognised safeguards.</p>\n<p><strong>9. Children's Privacy</strong></p>\n<p>Our Services are not intended for children under 16, and we do not knowingly collect their information. If you believe we have collected data about a child, please contact us to request deletion.</p>\n<p><strong>10. Security Measures</strong></p>\n<p>We implement industry-standard measures to protect your information. However, no system is completely secure, and we encourage you to protect your account credentials.</p>\n<p><strong>11. Third-Party Links</strong></p>\n<p>Our Site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, and we encourage you to review their policies before providing any personal information.</p>\n<p><strong>12. Privacy &amp; Data Protection</strong></p>\n<p>We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. Any personal data you share with us—such as your name, email address, wedding details, or contact information—is securely stored and used only to provide and improve our services.</p>\n<p>All information is handled in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). Your data will never be sold or shared with third parties without your consent, except when required to deliver our services.</p>\n<p>Your data is stored securely and only accessible to authorised members of our team. We take appropriate technical and organisational measures to ensure your information remains safe.</p>\n<p>You have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections, or ask for your data to be deleted at any time.</p>\n<p>If you have any questions about how your data is stored or used, please contact us.</p>\n<p><strong>13. Contact Us</strong></p>\n<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your rights, please get in touch with us:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@ejuno.io\">support@ejuno.io</a></li>\n<li><strong>Address:</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Dubai Commer City<br/>Business Cluster - Building 2<br/>BCB2 511-SD54, Fifth Floor<br/>Dubai, United Arab Emirates</p>\n<p>For further information, visit <a href=\"https://ejuno.io/\">ejuno.io</a>.</p>"
      }
